# Copy to .env (git-ignored) on the laptop and on the Vultr VM. See docs/TODO.md "CRITICAL".

# --- Vultr Serverless Inference (brain, speech-to-text, vision, memory embeddings) ---------
VULTR_INFERENCE_KEY=
# VULTR_INFERENCE_BASE=https://api.vultrinference.com/v1
